@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>

hpc:Mpiimplementation a owl:Class.
hpc:Slurmplugin a owl:Class.
hpc:Mpiconf a owl:Class.
hpc:Pmix a owl:Class.
hpc:Pmixversion a owl:Class.
hpc:Hwlocversion a owl:Class.

hpc:hasmpiimplementation a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasslurmplugin a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasmpiconf a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:usespmix a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:usesPMIxVersion rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty
